Highway 71 was shut down in the area for about nine hours. The Nebraska State Patrol is conducting a full crash reconstruction, including post-crash inspections of both commercial vehicles, and no cause for the collision has been released.</description></item><item><title>ECO Fuel Systems Offers Diesel Truck Fleets Fuel Savings and Reduced Emissions</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/eco-fuel-systems-offers-diesel-truck-fleets-fuel-savings-and-reduced-e-1e326eb5c4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/eco-fuel-systems-offers-diesel-truck-fleets-fuel-savings-and-reduced-e-1e326eb5c4/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:36:10 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>PRLog</description></item><item><title>Sparq: Logistics AI is paying off, but buyers want speed</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/sparq-logistics-ai-is-paying-off-but-buyers-want-speed-1540fd354c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/sparq-logistics-ai-is-paying-off-but-buyers-want-speed-1540fd354c/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:35:30 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>FreightWaves</description></item><item><title>Truck driver gets prison time for bilking $500K from employer through fuel cards</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/truck-driver-gets-prison-time-for-bilking-500k-from-employer-through-f-f50c2880bc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/truck-driver-gets-prison-time-for-bilking-500k-from-employer-through-f-f50c2880bc/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:22:04 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Commercial Carrier Journal</description></item><item><title>Protections for Independent Truckers Finalized Following ATA’s Advocacy</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/protections-for-independent-truckers-finalized-following-ata-s-advocac-d349461ed5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/protections-for-independent-truckers-finalized-followi